4. THE NAME AND LOGO - all rights reserved

The name "Zolsi.CC" and the Zolsi.CC logo are not covered by either licence
above. CC BY 4.0 explicitly does not grant trademark rights, and this is
deliberate: if you reuse or adapt this material, please credit Zolsi.CC as the
source, but do not present your version as being Zolsi.CC or as endorsed by it.
This matters more than usual for a site about child safety, where a reader
needs to know whether what they are reading has actually been checked.


5. A NOTE ON THE ADVICE ITSELF

Nothing in these licences is a warranty that the guidance is correct, current
or suitable for your situation, and none of it is legal or clinical advice.
Helplines, reporting routes and laws differ between countries and change over
time. If you republish this material, please re-verify the organisations and
phone numbers on the get help page first.
